.TH SYSTIDE 1 "2026-10-06" "systide 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
systide \- cross-distribution system update orchestrator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B systide
[OPTIONS]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -l, --list
Show available updates; selecting a row and pressing Enter starts the update flow.
.TP
.B --ui-lang LANG
UI language: auto, zh, or en (default: auto).
.TP
.B --news-source SOURCE
News source (default: official).
.TP
.B --count N
Number of news items (default: 15).
.TP
.B -h, --help
Print help.
.TP
.B -V, --version
Print version.
